<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLAND AND POLAND DRAW 0-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLAND AND POLAND DRAW 0-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>WOLVERHAMPTON, England 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>England and Poland</p>
<p>drew 0-0 in a European under-21 soccer championship group two</p>
<p>qualifier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,183</p>
